3592 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1243 0 R
/E (I make mostly beauty product reviews and fashion content. It's a mix. I do not create VC content like that frequently but once or twice in two weeks I upload a reel related to some beauty products. I started creating content around 7-8 months before and I only make Instagram Reels. I have around 3,000 followers right now on my Instagram page.  )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [26]
>>
endobj
3593 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1243 0 R
/E (Yes I have started earning money but I am mostly using agency and I have received a few brand deals. My follower count is not so great so big brands do not give me any kind of deals yet. Some middle-level brands can sometimes give you a deal but then they pay very little. Most of my income is coming through agencies. Affiliate program I have recently started. I am using Flipkart and Wishlink. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [27]
>>
endobj
3594 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1243 0 R
/E (I can join. There is no problem as such but if I'm already getting upfront money for posting a review and I don't even need to try the product myself \(I just need to show the bottle\), then it's a bit of friction for me to join a program and wait for people to click the link and receive the product there is one more problem with Meesho. A friend of mine actually received a fake product and she realized it after trying the product so she could not even return it and it could also have been harmful for her. Therefore I personally do not trust Meesho so much. Why are you selling something at half the price? And if I recommend something like this to some of my viewers and if they find something fake, then they'll also call me out so I just don't want to take the risk. I know there is something called Meesho Verified Products on the mall but if I can advertise products from somewhere else, I will not prefer Meesho. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [28]
>>
endobj
3595 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1243 0 R
/E (The main difference is that when we are approached by agencies they just give us a script or sometimes it is completely on us but they always send you the product. It just comes to my home and I get the script by mail. I just need to review the product as per the script. For affiliate the problem is that if I do not already have a product I'll specifically need to buy that. After that the money depends on how many people are getting through my link so I am unsure how much money I will earn through it. Direct deals are better because they tell you the money upfront. This is what you are going to receive. Sometimes there is no money but they just send the product and then the product is yours. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [29]
>>
endobj
